              "description": "Use this tool every time a user provides or corrects an email address during a playbook.\n\nPass the user's exact email into email_to_validate before accepting or saving it.\n\nThe tool checks the practical format, returns whether it is valid, and returns a cleaned lowercase version.\n\nDo not skip this tool when an email is required.",
