    },
    {
      "id": "6a5fa7ba84cfe5189e93d42b",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5fa79484cfe5189e93d422",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "So, what's on the agenda for today?"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5fa7ba84cfe5189e93d42c",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5fa79484cfe5189e93d422",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "What's the plan for today?"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a59fb0cbd8f9d2b707cf2e4",
      "discriminatorID": "6a59fae4bd8f9d2b707cf2db",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "Okay, what do you need assistance with?"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a59fb0cbd8f9d2b707cf2e5",
      "discriminatorID": "6a59fae4bd8f9d2b707cf2db",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "So, what can I help you with today?"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a59fb0cbd8f9d2b707cf2e6",
      "discriminatorID": "6a59fae4bd8f9d2b707cf2db",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "How can I assist you today?"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5a09b4bd8f9d2b707cf34f",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5a09b4bd8f9d2b707cf34e",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "I am a realtor"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5a09d6bd8f9d2b707cf35b",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5a09b4bd8f9d2b707cf34e",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "I work in real estate"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5a09d6bd8f9d2b707cf35c",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5a09b4bd8f9d2b707cf34e",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "I'm a real estate agent"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5a09d6bd8f9d2b707cf35d",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5a09b4bd8f9d2b707cf34e",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "I specialize in real estate"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5a09d6bd8f9d2b707cf35e",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5a09b4bd8f9d2b707cf34e",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "I deal with real estate"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5e180efab9d523d3fd18ab",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5e180efab9d523d3fd18aa",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "Perfect, thank you. Your tour request has been received. Justin or a member of the sales team will review your preferred date and time and contact you to confirm availability."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5aa957e77e91eef455a04d",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5aa957e77e91eef455a04c",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "I'd be happy to help you find the right home. I'll ask a few quick questions so I can recommend the communities that best match what you're looking for.\n\nFirst, which city or area are you most interested in?"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5aa98ae77e91eef455a051",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5aa957e77e91eef455a04c",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "I'd be happy to help you find the right home. I'll ask a few quick questions so I can recommend the communities that best match what you're looking for.\n\nFirst, which city or area are you most interested in?"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5aa994e77e91eef455a052",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5aa957e77e91eef455a04c",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "Sure, I can assist you in finding the perfect home. Let me ask a few questions to understand your preferences.To start, which city or area are you most interested in?"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5aa99ee77e91eef455a057",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5aa957e77e91eef455a04c",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "I'd love to help you find the perfect home. Let's start by narrowing down the area you're interested in."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5aa99ee77e91eef455a058",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5aa957e77e91eef455a04c",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "I'm here to assist you in your search for the right home. Let's begin by identifying the city or area you're focusing on."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5aa99ee77e91eef455a059",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5aa957e77e91eef455a04c",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "Absolutely, I can help you find the ideal home. To get started, tell me which city or area is your top choice."
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5ab1bae77e91eef455a093",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5ab1b4e77e91eef455a08e",
      "text": [
        {
          "text": [
            "I'd be happy to help with that.\r\nWhat community or home are you asking about?\r\n"
          ]
        }
      ],
      "condition": null,
      "delay": null,
      "createdAt": "2026-07-22T00:29:25.000Z"
    },
    {
      "id": "6a5ab1c2e77e91eef455a095",
      "discriminatorID": "6a5ab1b4e77e91eef455a08e",
      "text": [
